OL,3,GNEWSA'Cancer checks harder' to do in
OL,4,A10-minute appointments with GP
OL,5,
OL,6,FPressure to provide more GP
OL,7,Fappointments is making it harder to
OL,8,Finclude checks for gynaecological
OL,9,Fcancers within the 10-minute slots,
OL,10,Fdoctors have said.
OL,12,FDr Amara Naseem says her clinics always
OL,13,Foverrun as it takes about 20 minutes to
OL,14,Fsensitively take a detailed history and
OL,15,Fcarry out internal examinations.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
