OL,3,GNEWSA'Cancer checks harder' to do in
OL,4,A10-minute appointments with GP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA reduced number of practices in her
OL,7,Farea means she has taken on more
OL,8,Fpatients and fears there is a risk that
OL,9,Fwomen will not raise gynaecological
OL,10,Fsymptoms or attend screenings if
OL,11,Fappointments are rushed, painful or not
OL,12,Fhandled well.
OL,14,FThe Welsh government said it was
OL,15,Fincreasing investment in primary care
OL,16,Fand recruiting up to 100 extra GPs.
